---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<section id="cli" class="section wrap">
  <div class="sec-head" data-reveal="1">
    <h2>命令行与 MCP</h2>
    <p>
      每个菜单项、工具与对话框都运行同一个注册表里的命令。UI、CLI、JSON 控制通道与 MCP
      服务器调用的都是它们。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="exchanges">
    <div class="exchange" data-reveal="1">
      <h3>先打开一张 PSD。</h3>
      <div class="exchange__pair">
        <div class="code">
          <div class="code__bar">
            <span class="code__lang">sh</span>
            <button class="copy" type="button">复制</button>
          </div>
          <pre><code><span class="c"># 桌面应用，原生窗口</span>
cargo run --release -p photocraft -- image.psd</code></pre>
        </div>
        <div class="resp" data-ui="status">
          <div class="resp__head"><span>文档状态</span><span class="resp__ok">已打开</span></div>
          <div class="resp__row"><span>image.psd</span><span>3859 × 2594</span></div>
          <div class="resp__row"><span>RGB 色彩 · 8 位/通道</span><span>6 个图层</span></div>
          <div class="resp__row"><span>曲线 1 · 自然饱和度 1 · 文字 ×2</span><span>可编辑</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="exchange" data-reveal="2">
      <h3>再让脚本跑一整个文件夹。</h3>
      <div class="exchange__pair">
        <div class="code">
          <div class="code__bar">
            <span class="code__lang">sh</span>
            <button class="copy" type="button">复制</button>
          </div>
          <pre><code><span class="c"># 无界面模式：把一个动作列表应用到一整个图片文件夹</span>
photocraft-cli batch --actions grade.json --in ./raw --out ./graded</code></pre>
        </div>
        <div class="resp" data-ui="batch">
          <div class="resp__head"><span>batch · 4 张</span><span class="resp__ok">全部完成</span></div>
          <div class="resp__row"><span>raw/001.jpg → graded/001.png</span><span>完成</span></div>
          <div class="resp__row"><span>raw/002.jpg → graded/002.png</span><span>完成</span></div>
          <div class="resp__row"><span>raw/003.jpg → graded/003.png</span><span>完成</span></div>
          <div class="resp__row"><span>raw/004.jpg → graded/004.png</span><span>完成</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="exchange" data-reveal="3">
      <h3>最后让 Agent 通过 MCP 驱动它。</h3>
      <div class="exchange__pair">
        <div class="code">
          <div class="code__bar">
            <span class="code__lang">sh</span>
            <button class="copy" type="button">复制</button>
          </div>
          <pre><code><span class="c"># 无界面，或桥接到正在运行的应用</span>
photocraft-cli mcp

<span class="c"># 每个子命令都会自我说明</span>
photocraft-cli batch --help</code></pre>
        </div>
        <div class="resp" data-ui="mcp">
          <div class="resp__head"><span>MCP · 工具调用</span><span class="resp__ok">ok</span></div>
          <div class="resp__row resp__row--wide">
            <span>layer.newAdjustmentLayer.curves</span>
            <span>points [[0,0],[64,48],[192,212],[255,255]]</span>
          </div>
          <div class="resp__row"><span>filter.sharpen.smartSharpen</span><span>amount 80</span></div>
          <div class="resp__row"><span>返回 · 曲线 1 已建立，索引 3</span><span>已插入</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="plate__caption" data-reveal="3">
    <span>桌面应用另有仅限回环的认证控制通道，可以检视界面状态、截取离屏截图。</span>
    <span><a class="link" href={site.docs}>读文档</a></span>
  </p>
</section>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.code').forEach((box) => {
    const btn = box.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.copy');
    const code = box.querySelector('code');
    if (!btn || !code) return;
    btn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(code.textContent ?? '');
        btn.textContent = '已复制';
      } catch {
        btn.textContent = '按 Ctrl+C';
      }
      setTimeout(() => (btn.textContent = '复制'), 1600);
    });
  });
</script>
